<% content_for :title, "FAQ - #{app_full_name}" %>

<% content_for :header do %>
  <%= render "shared/login_navbar" %>
<% end %>

<div class="c-page c-container c-container--md">
  <header class="c-page-header">
    <div>
      <h1 class="c-page-title c-page-title--brand">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="c-page-subtitle">Common questions about using <%= app_full_name %>.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="u-stack">
    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">How do I log in as a student or advisor?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Use the "Students" or "Advisors" options at the top of the login page or the
        "Sign in with Google" buttons, depending on your role.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">Who do I contact if I can't see my surveys?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Reach out to your program administrator so they can verify your role and survey assignments.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">What are course competency results?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Course competency results come from faculty or Canvas course files. They show the competency level assessed in a course and, when available, the target level expected for that course.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">Why can't I see a recent course result yet?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Course results may be held until the program release date for that semester or course. If a result is not released yet, it may still be under review by program staff.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">What is the difference between a course target and a program target?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        A course target is the expected level for a specific course. A program target is the expected end-of-program level. They can be different because courses build toward the final program expectation over time.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">Why do self, advisor, and course scores look different?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        They come from different sources. Self scores come from your survey responses, advisor scores may reflect historical advisor feedback, and course scores come from imported course competency evidence.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">Can I download my competency information?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        When exports are enabled for your view, use the available CSV or PDF download options. Advisors and admins may also export student-level records for advising or program review.
      </p>
    </details>
    
    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">How do I complete and submit a survey?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Open the survey from the "Survey" tab, answer each question, and click "Submit" at the end. You can save progress and return later using the "Save progress" button.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">How do I view my competency history?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Use the "Competencies" tab to see current results and program-level summaries. For a detailed history, open a competency and review the history or request a portfolio export.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">Who can see my survey responses and competency results?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Your responses are visible to program staff according to your program's privacy settings. Advisors and admins may see aggregated or student-level data for advising and accreditation purposes.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">How do I change my account information?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Click your profile in the top-right, then choose "Account Information" or go to the "Settings" page to update your contact details. Some fields are managed by your institution and cannot be changed here.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">What accessibility features are available?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Use the "High Contrast" and "Read Aloud" toggles in the header to improve readability and enable text-to-speech. Screen-reader-friendly markup and keyboard navigation are supported across the site.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="c-card c-card--muted c-card--tight">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer"><span class="c-value">I found a bug or need help — who should I contact?</span></summary>
      <p class="mt-sm c-lede">
        Contact your program administrator or email the support address provided by your institution. Include screenshots and steps to reproduce the issue to help us resolve it faster.
      </p>
    </details>
  </section>
</div>
